{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "f8a9e102-1234-4567-89ab-cdef01234567",
    "name": "48Date - WebSocket & Real-Time Gateway",
    "description": "# 48Date WebSocket & Real-Time Gateway Collection\n\nDedicated collection containing **all real-time Socket.IO events, client actions, server broadcasts, and message payload variants** for 48Date (Chat Module 05, Games Module 06, Dates Module 07).\n\n### Connection Configuration\n- **Base Socket URL:** `{{socketUrl}}` (Default: `http://localhost:3000`)\n- **Protocol:** Socket.IO v4 (Engine.IO v4)\n- **Authentication:** Bearer Access Token passed via:\n  - Handshake query parameter: `?token={{accessToken}}`\n  - OR Handshake header: `Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}`\n- **Transports:** `['websocket', 'polling']`\n\n### Collection Structure\n1. **00 - Connection & Handshake:** Initial handshake, auth verification, and client setup.\n2. **01 - Client Actions (Emit Events):** Events sent by the Flutter client (`joinConversation`, `typing`, `message:seen`, etc.) with success and error responses.\n3. **02 - Server Broadcasts: message:new:** All 9 rich payload variants (`TEXT`, `IMAGE`, `VOICE`, `GAME` invitation/result, `DATE` requested/accepted/cancelled, `SYSTEM`).\n4. **03 - Server Broadcasts: Status & Receipts:** Live delivery receipts, seen receipts, typing indicators, and room closures.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "socketUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
