  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 - Connection & Handshake",
      "description": "Initial HTTP handshake and connection verification endpoints.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "01 Handshake (HTTP Polling) - Connect & Authenticate",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}",
                "description": "Bearer access token for handshake authentication (alternative to ?token query parameter)."
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{socketUrl}}/socket.io/?EIO=4&transport=polling&token={{accessToken}}",
              "host": [
                "{{socketUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "socket.io",
                ""
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "EIO",
                  "value": "4",
                  "description": "Engine.IO protocol version. Allowed values: 4."
                },
                {
                  "key": "transport",
                  "value": "polling",
                  "description": "Transport mechanism. Allowed values: polling, websocket."
                },
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{accessToken}}",
                  "description": "JWT bearer access token for socket authentication."
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Executes the initial Engine.IO handshake to establish a socket session.\n\n**Query params:**\n- `EIO` (string, required): Engine.IO protocol version (`4`).\n- `transport` (string, required): Initial transport (`polling`).\n- `token` (string, optional): Bearer token if not sent in Authorization header."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK — Handshake Successful",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"sid\": \"vraA7ZBlWRjQeTuSAAAQ\",\n  \"upgrades\": [\n    \"websocket\"\n  ],\n  \"pingInterval\": 25000,\n  \"pingTimeout\": 20000,\n  \"maxPayload\": 1000000\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "401 Unauthorized — Missing or Invalid Token",
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"code\": 4,\n  \"message\": \"Authentication token missing or invalid\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "02 Client Initialization & Connection (Flutter & JS Snippets)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{socketUrl}}/socket.io/info",
              "host": [
                "{{socketUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "socket.io",
                "info"
              ]
            },
            "description": "### Flutter `socket_io_client` Configuration\n\n```dart\nimport 'package:socket_io_client/socket_io_client.dart' as IO;\n\nfinal socket = IO.io(\n  'http://localhost:3000',\n  IO.OptionBuilder()\n    .setTransports(['websocket', 'polling'])\n    .disableAutoConnect()\n    .setAuth({'token': accessToken})\n    .setQuery({'token': accessToken})\n    .build(),\n);\n\nsocket.connect();\n\nsocket.onConnect((_) => print('Connected: ${socket.id}'));\nsocket.onDisconnect((_) => print('Disconnected'));\nsocket.on('message:new', (data) => handleNewMessage(data));\nsocket.on('conversation:receipt', (data) => handleReceipt(data));\nsocket.on('typing', (data) => handleTyping(data));\nsocket.on('conversation:closed', (data) => handleClosed(data));\n```\n\n### JavaScript / Web Client Configuration\n\n```javascript\nimport { io } from 'socket.io-client';\n\nconst socket = io('http://localhost:3000', {\n  auth: { token: accessToken },\n  query: { token: accessToken },\n  transports: ['websocket', 'polling']\n});\n```"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Client Config Reference",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"transports\": [\n    \"websocket\",\n    \"polling\"\n  ],\n  \"authParam\": \"token\",\n  \"heartbeatIntervalMs\": 25000,\n  \"heartbeatTimeoutMs\": 20000\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
